Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.48,0:22:19.53,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Même si tu penses que je fais face
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.53,0:22:24.78,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Ma tête est remplie d'espoir
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.78,0:22:33.67,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}D'un quelconque endroit autre qu'ici
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.71,0:22:39.71,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Même si tu penses que je souris
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.71,0:22:45.05,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Intérieurement et pendant tout ce temps
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.05,0:22:53.35,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Je m'interroge sur mon destin
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.98,0:22:59.94,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Je pense à
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.94,0:23:04.86,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Toutes les choses
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.86,0:23:09.78,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Que j'aimerais faire
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.78,0:23:14.08,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Dans ma vie
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.08,0:23:18.88,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Je suis un rêveur
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.88,0:23:24.09,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Un lointain songeur
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.09,0:23:29.60,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Rêvant d'espoir
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.60,0:23:33.73,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)\fs65}Dès à présent
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.48,0:22:19.53,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Although you think I cope
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.53,0:22:24.78,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}My head is filled with hope
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.78,0:22:33.67,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Of some place other than here
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.71,0:22:39.71,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Although you think I smile
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.71,0:22:45.05,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Inside and all the while
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.05,0:22:53.35,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I'm wondering about my destiny
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.98,0:22:59.94,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I'm thinking about
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.94,0:23:04.86,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}All the things
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.86,0:23:09.78,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I'd like to do
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.78,0:23:14.08,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}In my life
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.08,0:23:18.88,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I'm a dreamer
